Description: eco-printer: capture each printed page as a 1-bit PBM
 Writes job-<id>-page-<n>.pbm to /var/spool/lprint-capture (when that
 directory exists) so ECO Label Studio can preview and reprint every job,
 including AirPrint jobs.
Author: Andrew Clausen <andrew@clausen.app>
